## Basic Setup
apt-get update && apt-get install apt-file -y && apt-file update && apt-get install vim -y


## ComfyUI Related
comfy node update all
comfy node show all
## Installing missing nodes [Supported by Official CLI]
 
comfy node install-deps --workflow test-workflow.json
or 
comfy node deps-in-workflow --workflow test-workflow.json --output test.json
comfy node install-deps --deps test.json

## Managing models [Tool: https://github.com/piyushK52/comfy_runner]
comfy model

## Managing the 'Manager'
comfy manager